{{ .SchemaMarkdown | trimspace }}

## Import

Registries can be imported using their ID:

```shell
terraform import dokploy_registry.example hij456-registry-id
```

Or using import blocks (Terraform 1.5+):

```hcl
import {
  to = dokploy_registry.example
  id = "hij456-registry-id"
}
```

### Finding Registry IDs

Use the `dokploy_registries` data source to discover registry IDs:

```hcl
data "dokploy_registries" "all" {}

output "registry_ids" {
  value = { for r in data.dokploy_registries.all.registries : r.name => r.id }
}
```

~> **Note:** Sensitive values like `password` will not be populated during import. You will need to set these values in your configuration after import.
